{
  "_readme": [
    "This file is the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the EventCatalog site in this POC.",
    "It is a hand-written stand-in for what a future ITS RMS 'business module' / 'event listing'",
    "admin form (or its database table) would produce. Nothing here is read from the running",
    "FastAPI code - EventCatalog does not inspect Python. eventcatalog/scripts/sync-catalog.js",
    "reads this file and writes the catalog using @eventcatalog/sdk.",
    "All sample data shown in the examples below is FICTIONAL."
  ],
  "catalog": {
    "title": "ITS RMS Event Catalog (POC)",
    "organizationName": "ITS RMS - Proof of Concept",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "broker": {
      "type": "RabbitMQ",
      "exchange": "its.rms.events",
      "exchangeType": "topic",
      "managementUi": "http://localhost:15672"
    }
  },

  "domains": [
    {
      "id": "identity-and-access",
      "name": "Identity & Access",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "Combined login and role selection. One phone number may hold several roles.",
      "owners": [],
      "styles": { "icon": "ShieldCheckIcon", "node": { "color": "blue" } },
      "description": [
        "The Identity & Access domain answers one question: **who is using the system right now, and in what role?**",
        "",
        "In the ITS RMS medical camp world a single phone number is often several people at once:",
        "the same volunteer may be an `Admin` for one camp and a `Data Entry` operator for another.",
        "So login and role selection are treated as one combined step.",
        "",
        "### Roles in this POC",
        "`Super Admin`, `Admin`, `Data Entry`, `Doctor`, `Patient`",
        "",
        "> **POC limits.** There is no password, no OTP check and no JWT signing. Users are hard-coded and fictional."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-operations",
      "name": "Camp Operations",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "Camp configuration, patient registration and consultation slot booking.",
      "owners": [],
      "styles": { "icon": "BuildingOffice2Icon", "node": { "color": "green" } },
      "description": [
        "The Camp Operations domain owns everything that happens **before** a patient sees a doctor.",
        "",
        "1. An admin configures a camp: name, host city, location, start/end date, timezone and the departments offered.",
        "2. A patient (or a Data Entry operator on their behalf) is registered against that camp.",
        "3. A consultation slot is booked for a department, a date and a session.",
        "",
        "This domain is the main **publisher** in the POC: registering a patient and booking a slot are the two",
        "facts the clinical side needs to know about.",
        "",
        "> **POC limits.** Storage is an in-memory dictionary and all patients and camps are fictional sample data."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clinical-care",
      "name": "Clinical Care",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "Doctor consultation: vitals, diagnosis and case closure.",
      "owners": [],
      "styles": { "icon": "HeartIcon", "node": { "color": "pink" } },
      "description": [
        "The Clinical Care domain owns what happens **once the patient is in front of a doctor**.",
        "",
        "It never calls Camp Operations directly. It learns about patients and slots purely by",
        "**consuming events**, which is the whole point of the POC:",
        "",
        "| It hears | It does |",
        "| --- | --- |",
        "| `PatientRegistered` | Opens a new clinical case |",
        "| `SlotBooked` | Attaches the consultation slot to that case |",
        "",
        "The doctor then records vitals and a diagnosis, and closes the case.",
        "",
        "> **POC limits.** All clinical values are fictional. Nothing here is medical advice or a real record."
      ]
    }
  ],

  "services": [
    {
      "id": "identity-service",
      "name": "Identity Service",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "domain": "identity-and-access",
      "port": 8001,
      "docsUrl": "http://localhost:8001/docs",
      "summary": "Fake login and role selection for the medical camp POC.",
      "styles": { "icon": "KeyIcon", "node": { "color": "blue" } },
      "repository": { "language": "Python", "url": "./identity-service" },
      "publishes": ["UserLoggedIn"],
      "consumes": [],
      "endpoints": [
        { "method": "POST", "path": "/login", "description": "Fictional phone-number login. Returns available roles and a fake session token. Publishes UserLoggedIn." },
        { "method": "POST", "path": "/select-role", "description": "Pick one of the roles the phone number holds for this session." },
        { "method": "GET", "path": "/demo-users", "description": "List the fictional demo logins." },
        { "method": "GET", "path": "/health", "description": "Liveness probe used by Docker Compose." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "camp-service",
      "name": "Camp Service",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "domain": "camp-operations",
      "port": 8002,
      "docsUrl": "http://localhost:8002/docs",
      "summary": "Camp configuration, patient registration and slot booking.",
      "styles": { "icon": "ClipboardDocumentListIcon", "node": { "color": "green" } },
      "repository": { "language": "Python", "url": "./camp-service" },
      "publishes": ["PatientRegistered", "SlotBooked"],
      "consumes": ["UserLoggedIn"],
      "endpoints": [
        { "method": "GET", "path": "/camps/availability", "description": "Patient portal view of open camps." },
        { "method": "POST", "path": "/camps", "description": "Create a camp configuration." },
        { "method": "POST", "path": "/patients/register", "description": "Register a fictional patient. Publishes PatientRegistered." },
        { "method": "POST", "path": "/slots/book", "description": "Book a consultation slot. Publishes SlotBooked." },
        { "method": "GET", "path": "/login-activity", "description": "Proof that UserLoggedIn was consumed (logging only)." },
        { "method": "GET", "path": "/health", "description": "Liveness probe used by Docker Compose." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clinical-service",
      "name": "Clinical Service",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "domain": "clinical-care",
      "port": 8003,
      "docsUrl": "http://localhost:8003/docs",
      "summary": "Opens cases from events, records vitals and diagnosis, closes cases.",
      "styles": { "icon": "HeartIcon", "node": { "color": "pink" } },
      "repository": { "language": "Python", "url": "./clinical-service" },
      "publishes": ["VitalsRecorded", "CaseClosed"],
      "consumes": ["PatientRegistered", "SlotBooked"],
      "endpoints": [
        { "method": "GET", "path": "/cases", "description": "List cases. Cases are created by consuming PatientRegistered." },
        { "method": "POST", "path": "/cases/{case_id}/vitals", "description": "Record vitals. Publishes VitalsRecorded." },
        { "method": "POST", "path": "/cases/{case_id}/diagnosis", "description": "Record chief complaint, diagnosis, medication and follow-up." },
        { "method": "POST", "path": "/cases/{case_id}/close", "description": "Close the case. Publishes CaseClosed." },
        { "method": "GET", "path": "/health", "description": "Liveness probe used by Docker Compose." }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "events": [
    {
      "id": "UserLoggedIn",
      "name": "User Logged In",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "A fictional user signed in and their available roles were resolved.",
      "routingKey": "user.logged-in",
      "producedBy": "identity-service",
      "consumedBy": [],
      "styles": { "node": { "color": "blue" } },
      "description": [
        "Emitted by `identity-service` immediately after a successful (fake) login.",
        "",
        "`camp-service` binds a queue to this routing key **for demonstration and logging only** -",
        "it does not change any business state when it hears this event."
      ],
      "schema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "title": "UserLoggedIn",
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["eventId", "eventType", "occurredAt", "source", "data"],
        "properties": {
          "eventId": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "eventType": { "type": "string", "const": "UserLoggedIn" },
          "eventVersion": { "type": "string", "examples": ["1.0.0"] },
          "occurredAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "source": { "type": "string", "const": "identity-service" },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["userId", "phone", "availableRoles", "sessionToken"],
            "properties": {
              "userId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["usr-1001"] },
              "phone": { "type": "string", "examples": ["+919999999999"] },
              "displayName": { "type": "string", "examples": ["Fatema Demo (fictional)"] },
              "availableRoles": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": { "type": "string", "enum": ["Super Admin", "Admin", "Data Entry", "Doctor", "Patient"] }
              },
              "sessionToken": { "type": "string", "description": "Fake token. Not a JWT, not signed." },
              "loggedInAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "example": {
        "eventId": "6b1f0e0a-1111-4c2f-9a0b-000000000001",
        "eventType": "UserLoggedIn",
        "eventVersion": "1.0.0",
        "occurredAt": "2026-09-01T08:00:00+00:00",
        "source": "identity-service",
        "data": {
          "userId": "usr-1001",
          "phone": "+919999999999",
          "displayName": "Fatema Demo (fictional)",
          "availableRoles": ["Admin", "Data Entry"],
          "sessionToken": "fake-session-ab12cd34ef56",
          "loggedInAt": "2026-09-01T08:00:00+00:00"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "PatientRegistered",
      "name": "Patient Registered",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "A fictional patient was registered against a camp.",
      "routingKey": "patient.registered",
      "producedBy": "camp-service",
      "consumedBy": ["clinical-service"],
      "styles": { "node": { "color": "green" } },
      "description": [
        "The first real business event in the flow.",
        "",
        "`clinical-service` consumes it and **opens a clinical case** for that patient.",
        "That is the only way a case comes into existence in this POC - there is no",
        "HTTP endpoint to create one."
      ],
      "schema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "title": "PatientRegistered",
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["eventId", "eventType", "occurredAt", "source", "data"],
        "properties": {
          "eventId": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "eventType": { "type": "string", "const": "PatientRegistered" },
          "eventVersion": { "type": "string", "examples": ["1.0.0"] },
          "occurredAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "source": { "type": "string", "const": "camp-service" },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["patientId", "patientName", "phone", "campId", "patientType"],
            "properties": {
              "patientId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["PAT-0001"] },
              "patientName": { "type": "string", "examples": ["Zainab Demo (fictional)"] },
              "phone": { "type": "string", "examples": ["+919777777777"] },
              "campId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["CAMP-0001"] },
              "patientType": { "type": "string", "enum": ["ITS member", "non-ITS member"] },
              "registeredBy": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "User id of the Admin / Data Entry operator" },
              "registeredAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
              "sampleData": { "type": "boolean", "const": true, "description": "Always true - this POC only ever emits fictional patients." }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "example": {
        "eventId": "6b1f0e0a-2222-4c2f-9a0b-000000000002",
        "eventType": "PatientRegistered",
        "eventVersion": "1.0.0",
        "occurredAt": "2026-09-01T08:05:00+00:00",
        "source": "camp-service",
        "data": {
          "patientId": "PAT-0001",
          "patientName": "Zainab Demo (fictional)",
          "phone": "+919777777777",
          "campId": "CAMP-0001",
          "patientType": "ITS member",
          "registeredBy": "usr-1001",
          "registeredAt": "2026-09-01T08:05:00+00:00",
          "sampleData": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SlotBooked",
      "name": "Slot Booked",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "A consultation slot was booked for a registered patient.",
      "routingKey": "slot.booked",
      "producedBy": "camp-service",
      "consumedBy": ["clinical-service"],
      "styles": { "node": { "color": "green" } },
      "description": [
        "Booking a slot tells Clinical Care **which department, day and session** the patient is expected in.",
        "",
        "`clinical-service` attaches the slot to the patient's open case. If the slot event somehow",
        "arrives before the patient event, the POC parks it and attaches it as soon as the case exists."
      ],
      "schema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "title": "SlotBooked",
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["eventId", "eventType", "occurredAt", "source", "data"],
        "properties": {
          "eventId": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "eventType": { "type": "string", "const": "SlotBooked" },
          "eventVersion": { "type": "string", "examples": ["1.0.0"] },
          "occurredAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "source": { "type": "string", "const": "camp-service" },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["slotId", "patientId", "campId", "department", "date", "session"],
            "properties": {
              "slotId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["SLOT-0001"] },
              "patientId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["PAT-0001"] },
              "campId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["CAMP-0001"] },
              "department": { "type": "string", "examples": ["General Medicine", "Dental", "Ophthalmology"] },
              "date": { "type": "string", "format": "date", "examples": ["2026-09-02"] },
              "session": { "type": "string", "enum": ["Morning", "Afternoon", "Evening"] },
              "bookedAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "example": {
        "eventId": "6b1f0e0a-3333-4c2f-9a0b-000000000003",
        "eventType": "SlotBooked",
        "eventVersion": "1.0.0",
        "occurredAt": "2026-09-01T08:06:00+00:00",
        "source": "camp-service",
        "data": {
          "slotId": "SLOT-0001",
          "patientId": "PAT-0001",
          "campId": "CAMP-0001",
          "department": "General Medicine",
          "date": "2026-09-02",
          "session": "Morning",
          "bookedAt": "2026-09-01T08:06:00+00:00"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "VitalsRecorded",
      "name": "Vitals Recorded",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "A doctor recorded temperature, blood pressure and weight on a case.",
      "routingKey": "vitals.recorded",
      "producedBy": "clinical-service",
      "consumedBy": [],
      "styles": { "node": { "color": "pink" } },
      "description": [
        "Published when a doctor saves vitals for an open case.",
        "",
        "Nothing consumes it in this POC. It is deliberately left unconsumed to show what an",
        "**available but unused** event looks like on the catalog map - a real system would",
        "hang analytics, alerting or a patient-history service off this."
      ],
      "schema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "title": "VitalsRecorded",
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["eventId", "eventType", "occurredAt", "source", "data"],
        "properties": {
          "eventId": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "eventType": { "type": "string", "const": "VitalsRecorded" },
          "eventVersion": { "type": "string", "examples": ["1.0.0"] },
          "occurredAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "source": { "type": "string", "const": "clinical-service" },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["caseId", "patientId", "temperature", "bloodPressure", "weight"],
            "properties": {
              "caseId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["CASE-0001"] },
              "patientId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["PAT-0001"] },
              "temperature": { "type": "number", "description": "Degrees Celsius", "examples": [37.2] },
              "bloodPressure": { "type": "string", "examples": ["120/80"] },
              "weight": { "type": "number", "description": "Kilograms", "examples": [68.5] },
              "notes": { "type": ["string", "null"], "examples": ["Mild headache reported (fictional)"] },
              "recordedBy": { "type": ["string", "null"], "examples": ["usr-1002"] },
              "recordedAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "example": {
        "eventId": "6b1f0e0a-4444-4c2f-9a0b-000000000004",
        "eventType": "VitalsRecorded",
        "eventVersion": "1.0.0",
        "occurredAt": "2026-09-02T09:15:00+00:00",
        "source": "clinical-service",
        "data": {
          "caseId": "CASE-0001",
          "patientId": "PAT-0001",
          "temperature": 37.2,
          "bloodPressure": "120/80",
          "weight": 68.5,
          "notes": "Mild headache reported (fictional)",
          "recordedBy": "usr-1002",
          "recordedAt": "2026-09-02T09:15:00+00:00"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "CaseClosed",
      "name": "Case Closed",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "summary": "The consultation finished and the clinical case was closed.",
      "routingKey": "case.closed",
      "producedBy": "clinical-service",
      "consumedBy": [],
      "styles": { "node": { "color": "pink" } },
      "description": [
        "The last event in the POC flow. Carries the diagnosis summary so downstream systems",
        "would not need to call back into Clinical Care.",
        "",
        "Nothing consumes it here. In a real ITS RMS this is where reporting, follow-up",
        "reminders or pharmacy would plug in."
      ],
      "schema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "title": "CaseClosed",
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["eventId", "eventType", "occurredAt", "source", "data"],
        "properties": {
          "eventId": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "eventType": { "type": "string", "const": "CaseClosed" },
          "eventVersion": { "type": "string", "examples": ["1.0.0"] },
          "occurredAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "source": { "type": "string", "const": "clinical-service" },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["caseId", "patientId", "closedAt"],
            "properties": {
              "caseId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["CASE-0001"] },
              "patientId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["PAT-0001"] },
              "campId": { "type": "string", "examples": ["CAMP-0001"] },
              "chiefComplaint": { "type": ["string", "null"], "examples": ["Headache and fatigue for 3 days (fictional)"] },
              "diagnosis": { "type": ["string", "null"], "examples": ["Tension headache (fictional)"] },
              "medication": { "type": ["string", "null"], "examples": ["Paracetamol 500mg twice daily (fictional)"] },
              "followUpDate": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date", "examples": ["2026-09-15"] },
              "closedBy": { "type": ["string", "null"], "examples": ["usr-1002"] },
              "closedAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "example": {
        "eventId": "6b1f0e0a-5555-4c2f-9a0b-000000000005",
        "eventType": "CaseClosed",
        "eventVersion": "1.0.0",
        "occurredAt": "2026-09-02T09:40:00+00:00",
        "source": "clinical-service",
        "data": {
          "caseId": "CASE-0001",
          "patientId": "PAT-0001",
          "campId": "CAMP-0001",
          "chiefComplaint": "Headache and fatigue for 3 days (fictional)",
          "diagnosis": "Tension headache (fictional)",
          "medication": "Paracetamol 500mg twice daily (fictional)",
          "followUpDate": "2026-09-15",
          "closedBy": "usr-1002",
          "closedAt": "2026-09-02T09:40:00+00:00"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
